+    """Read a binary file-like object while displaying progress.
+
+    The display is started when the returned context manager is entered and
+    stopped when it exits. The file object is not closed.
+
+    Args:
+        file (BinaryIO): A binary file-like object to read from.
+        total (int): Size of the file in bytes.
